  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "不動產投資與金融",
    "sub_ename": "REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT AND FINANCE",
    "describe_ch": "本系碩士班以「不動產經營與管理」為教學特色，並為企業識別本系碩士專長的評斷依據，「不動產投資分析」亦為不動產估價師考試科目。依此發展目標，本課程將探討不動產投資與金融相關理論與分析方法，授課主題為不動產投資概論、不動產投資分析程序、財務可行性分析 、現金流量折現分析、報酬與風險分析、不動產金融、不動產證券以及綠色金融等，並融入金融科技與不動產科技於應用層面之探討。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "The characteristic of the master's class in Land Management is \"Real Estate Management\", which is used by enterprises to identify the master's major, and \"Real Estate Investment Analysis\" is also a subject of the real estate appraiser license examination. Therefore, this master's program will explore theoretical and analytical methods related to real estate investment and finance. The topics of this course include: Introduction to Real Estate Investment, Real Estate Investment Analysis Procedures, Financial Feasibility Analysis, Discounted Cash Flow Analysis, Income and Risk Analysis, Real Estate Finance, Real Estate Securities and Green Finance, etc., and integrates the application of Financial Technology and Property Technology.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解不動產投資與金融工具及分析方法\t",
      "describe_en": "Understand real estate investment and financial instruments and analysis methods"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "訓練解決不動產經營管理專業問題之能力\t",
      "describe_en": "Train the ability to solve real estate management problems."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "培養社會責任與國際視野\t",
      "describe_en": "Develop a sense of social responsibility and an international perspective."
    }
  ],
